WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:03.390
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:06.350
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.490
With the feelings of being embraced by the warm and gentle sun...

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:20.870
We're Soleil!

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:22.370
Ran!

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.040
<i>Dear Ran, I've decided.</i>

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.220
<i>I don't want to rain on your heart any longer.</i>

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:33.270
<i>I'm removing you from Tristar.</i>

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.800
<i>You deserve to be able to shine under the sun.</i>

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>Even if our paths differ,</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.870
<i>let's both shine together in the same sky. {I assume this is the same as last episode, but "both" is redundant here}{oops}</i>

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:42.560
<i>Mizuki.</i>

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:46.480
Let's all work together so we can outshine even Mizuki-san!

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:47.810
Let's!

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.330
From now on, the three of us will always shine together.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.880
Soleil's getting a ton of attention already.

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.380
Everyone's talking about us on KiraKiratter.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:36.160
Our name is great too.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.240
Soleil—the shining sun. {punctuation?}

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:40.510
Go get 'em! {defer until later- TL note?}

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:41.890
What are you, an old man?

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:45.800
Go get 'em!

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:48.060
Soleil, go get 'em!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.820
This isn't like you.

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:58.910
Shibuki wasn't meant to be a member of Tristar.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:05.590
You misunderstand.  I meant that you thinking your judgement was wrong is unusual. {ugh?}

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:10.480
I'm sure I'll find someone who can shine as the third member of Tristar.

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:16.120
Tristar will certainly continue to shine many years into the future.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.720
I love potato chips! {no way those are potato chips}

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:29.140
Can't you eat and listen at the same time?

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:30.660
What were you saying?

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:32.870
We're talking about who'll be the leader.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:36.270
Oh, right! Having a leader is really important.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.740
All idol groups need one.

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:41.110
That's exactly what I just said.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:45.370
That's why we need to hurry up and decide which of us it's going to be.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:49.040
I think our leader should be the person with the most passion.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.590
Agreed.

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:54.780
I want someone who can support and encourage the others through thick and thin.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:56.130
Agreed!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.630
I think she should wear a red ribbon.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.140
Agreed!

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.890
Hey, wait! I'm the leader?!

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:09.100
But I'm not ready for those responsibilities...

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.390
Ichigo, listen.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:11.890
Okay.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:14.530
I don't think you're like a typical idol.

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:17.040
It's like everything comes naturally to you.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.700
You've got strong resolve too.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.400
So, please lead us well from now on.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:26.910
S-Same here.

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:32.040
I know we're trying to be serious, but the smell of these is distracting.

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:36.240
From this day forward,

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:39.920
this meeting shall go down in idol history as "The Potato Chip Promise"!

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.920
We aren't making a big mistake here, are we?

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.570
Of course not, there's nothing to worry about...

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:51.310
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.060
Alright, let's take a quick break.

00:04:57.820 --> 00:05:00.180
Why do I get the feeling we're doing nothing but jog?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:03.040
"The number one important thing for idols is stamina."

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:05.070
It's not like I disagree...

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:09.780
We sure worked up a good sweat.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.800
The breeze after a run always feels so relaxing.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:16.540
Otome-chan, what're you all up to?

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.190
Sakura-tan, please start us off.

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:21.550
Huh? C-Certainly.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:24.840
Every idol's dream...

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:28.860
Yes! To form a unit!

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:34.160
Unit! How fulfilling yet final it sounds!

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.690
An actvity one cannot perform alone...

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:39.690
Only by joining hands with one another

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.440
can it finally begin!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:46.440
That's why we all decided to make our own unit!

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:47.660
That's amazing!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:51.290
Does that mean you're doing this without any help from the headmistress?

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:53.770
We're doing it all by ourselves.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.200
What's your unit name?

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.710
Powa Powa Puririn! {...?} {it's fine}

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.090
Wait, we already decided?

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:03.280
I liked "Blooming Flower Girls" myself...

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:06.010
As the leader, I just decided!

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:08.110
I don't remember hearing that either...

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:10.220
You're the leader, Otome-sama?

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:11.270
Aye!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.430
I'm not surprised, Otome-chan.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:18.150
Aye! Our unit, Powa Powa Puririn, starts now!

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.900
C'mon, we can't sit around forever!

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.430
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:25.400
Wait up!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:39.080
Otome-sama, are you sure that this decision was prudent?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:43.470
The leader always has to be running in front of her members.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:47.170
Therefore... I wrote lyrics for our debut song!

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:58.160
Powa powa powawawa!

00:06:58.160 --> 00:06:59.990
Popcorn is our rhythm.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:02.780
Pop pop goes the popcorn!

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:06.230
Our melody is happy happy pop candy!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:08.770
We're always feeling like Pop'n, yeah!

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:11.650
Gentle chocolate becomes our harmony! {I feel so silly changing this line}

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:14.580
The sweet scent of melting chocolate!

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:17.780
Bring together all sorts of fun things!

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:21.650
Bring together all sorts of lovely things!

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:24.840
Fill the world with powa powa!

00:07:25.430 --> 00:07:29.540
Powa powa powawawan!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.940
That is a masterpiece, Otome-sama.

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:39.730
It truly could not have been written by anyone else. It even goes beyond human understanding.

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:43.230
I get that she just said things she likes, but not much else...

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:46.700
Otome's sad you don't get it...

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.870
But I'm still far from finished!

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:55.460
I'm getting a headache just listening to her, but this might work.

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:59.250
I agree. Above all, this is Otome-sama's song.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:01.750
Puri puwa puri pura powa puririn!

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:04.600
This is going to be quite fun.

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:07.380
Maybe we should tone it down a little.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:13.700
Aikatsu... Aikatsu...

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:17.460
Doesn't it feel like we're really supporting Ichigo to do her best right now?

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:18.890
You took the words out of my mouth.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.050
I'll turn to ash in the sun!

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:57.550
Three-second rule though, so I'm fine.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:00.060
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:02.770
Even when she's all alone...

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:13.490
Every good idol dance includes a segment even your fans should be able to do easily.

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:16.450
This allows the fans to participate during concerts.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:21.450
However, your dance is far too complicated to mimic.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.200
It's a failure.

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:25.210
Please...

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:28.230
Do you base which auditions you take on the outfits you'll wear?

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:33.210
If your dance can't overcome your dress, you're doing a disservice to both your coord and yourself.

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.060
Overcome the dress?

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:36.970
How do we do that?

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:41.060
Is that thing on your shoulders a pumpkin? Perhaps a balloon?

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:45.010
How many times do I need to tell you to think about it yourselves?

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:46.100
Especially Hoshimiya!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:49.620
You're Soleil's leader, correct?

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:53.770
Think hard about what direction you want to take the unit's dancing in.

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:55.580
Okay, I will!

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.990
So let's begin the training!

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:04.180
I don't get it.

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:07.580
It's training to overcome any dress!

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:13.250
If we can dance in animal suits, then we can dance in anything!

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:15.420
I <i>do</i> see your point...

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:18.240
I wanted to wear the bunny one.

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:19.050
Seriously?!

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:22.530
Focus, focus! Let's start dancing.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:26.020
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:35.030
Snacks after training are always the best.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:37.490
Hey, Ichigo...

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:38.670
Want some?

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.560
So good!

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:44.990
Right?

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.010
Don't get distracted.

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:51.150
Anyway, Ichigo, what kind of unit do you want Soleil to be?

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:52.870
What kind?

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:57.210
We want to know what kind of unit you think would be good.

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:04.720
Aoi, what do leaders normally do, anyway?

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:08.920
Well, every unit's leader does things a little differently.

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:14.350
Some take charge and focus on displaying everyone's abilities as a group,

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:19.450
while others back off, letting each member express their quirks and uniqueness.

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:22.130
Those both sound too hard.

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:26.950
Some leaders even take the position of manager and take care of their group's schedule.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:29.790
Also, they decide who MCs which shows,

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:35.420
who appears in variety programs, and basically learn everything about the members and bring out their latent strengths.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.210
That doesn't sound like Ichigo to me.

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:41.640
But none of that really matters. 
What do you want to do, Ichigo?

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:49.850
I'll think about it as I eat.

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:54.100
Right, guess we can't expect you to have an answer right away.

00:11:56.180 --> 00:12:00.170
I might get a flash of inspiration from all the sugar.

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:07.120
I got it! I'll become a strawberry!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:10.120
What do you mean? Aren't you already one? {but then again, I was also the one who preferred "Ironic, right?" for Iwai's name thing}

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.680
That's not what I mean.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:15.880
I'll become the strawberry on top of a parfait, bright red like the sun.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:17.880
What's this?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.520
A strawberry parfait without the strawberry.

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:21.820
In other words...

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:23.510
In other words?

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.760
Just a parfait?

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.680
That's right. So...

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:28.890
When you put a strawberry on top?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.640
Ta-dah! A strawberry parfait!

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:34.120
So?

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:36.620
You don't get it?

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:39.340
Oh, I think I understand.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:43.230
She's saying that the strawberry makes it a strawberry parfait.

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:47.460
Chocolate makes it a chocolate parfait, and fruit makes it a fruit parfait.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:49.540
I knew you were my friend for a reason, Aoi.

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:53.160
Are you saying that we're just a plain parfait?

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:54.800
No, don't get me wrong.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.290
A strawberry without a parfait is just a strawberry.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.170
Only together are they complete! {no, not your Aoi-rashikunai nonsense}

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:04.050
We'll make Soleil a unit that can shine as brightly as a strawberry parfait.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:05.700
Exactly!

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:08.650
It sounds really convincing coming from you.

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:16.960
Ever since Starmiya—no, Hoshimiya—
became Soleil's leader...

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:18.020
Chaos!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.440
Everything is falling to pieces!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.980
It certainly isn't boring.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.590
Interesting!

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:25.450
But will she be alright?

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.450
It might've been a mistake to let Hoshimiya be the leader.

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:31.580
That girl is a linchpin.

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:34.080
A linchpin?

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:37.420
Yes, like the pin that holds a fan together.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:41.050
Without that pin, the fan would fall to pieces.

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:46.590
She has the natural ability to bring others to her side. {detective looks tacked on}

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.150
I see...

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:51.560
However, the pin can't actually move on its own.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:54.420
True... but, but—!

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:58.350
It's not that Hoshimiya <i>can't </i>move, it's that we have no idea <i>where</i> she'll move!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:03.270
Isn't that what make her interesting? 
We have no idea which direction she'll take.

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:09.310
I was never expecting Soleil's leader to be able to take full control of the group.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.480
Are you just looking for excitement?

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:14.940
Come in.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.950
That look in your eyes...

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:29.130
I take it you've picked a new member for Tristar?

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:32.250
Yes. {Oh come on, this is like the one time when you can actually translate hai as yes}

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:50.950
Mizuki-san...

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.280
Ran, you're so bright right now.

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:57.040
I mean it.

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:00.040
Thank you.

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.950
But you know,

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.510
Soleil and Tristar are rivals.

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:06.550
Let's aim for greater heights together.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.300
Right!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.430
I've decided who Tristar's new member will be.

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:18.310
Would you let me pass on the Cyan Trio Coord cards to that new member?

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.310
I really want to do this.

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:27.820
I heard that Tristar's third member was picked.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:28.820
Wonder who it is?

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:29.720
Otome-chan?

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:30.870
I wonder...

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:32.320
It might even be Sakura-chan!

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:41.290
Mizuki-san, is it true that you've chosen Tristar's new third member?

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:44.790
Yes, we've come to a decision.

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:50.300
The third member who will walk alongside us down this path. Her name is...

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.250
Toudou Yurika!

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:58.430
So it's Yurika.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:01.190
It feels like the answer was under our noses the whole time.

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:04.560
Yurika-chan should be fine with her 600 years of experience.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.770
Toudou-san, how do you feel about this turn of events?

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:08.360
What will you be doing from now on?

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.560
What do you think about joining?

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:11.200
Have you told your family yet?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.950
Do you feel any pressure from joining Tristar?

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:16.240
Pressure?

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:20.050
That word doesn't exist in my dictionary.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:25.600
Yurika's amazing. Despite joining Tristar, she's not hiding her personality at all.

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:27.670
She's staying completely in character.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:33.720
I wonder how amazing Tristar will become now that Yurika-chan's joined.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:37.870
And with the formation of a new Tristar,

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:41.310
we will hold the "Tristar and Soleil: Special Live!"

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.560
A joint concert?

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:47.460
An unexpected development.

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:48.480
But even so...

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:49.860
Let's do it!

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.790
I finally found you.

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:11.550
I couldn't sleep.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:15.590
I'm so excited! I still can't believe I was chosen...

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:20.810
I wanted to give you this.

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:27.440
It's Tristar's Cyan Trio Coord.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:32.940
Now it's your turn to wear that and show me the best performance you can.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:35.030
Tonight is a full moon.

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:37.700
My power is at its peak!

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:40.960
The blood of the Moon King runs through my veins! {unless you want to scrap "Moon King"}

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.170
Let's turn Soleil into a strawberry parfait!

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:48.990
Yeah!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.750
Great performance!

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:30.480
Turns out it <i>was</i> the right choice to make Hoshimiya the leader of Soleil.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:33.500
Who was the one worrying the most, I wonder? {reworded because eurgh}

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.390
Otome-chan!

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:36.510
Ichigo-tan!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:38.760
Love you!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.760
That was a wonderful performance!

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.010
Thanks!

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.010
What about Tristar?

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.260
They're about to go on.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.870
So this is the new Tristar.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.000
Yurika fit in perfectly.

00:21:56.180 --> 00:21:58.040
It gave me goosebumps!

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:01.880
That was a great start for the new Tristar.

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:06.890
New units are being born one after another in Starlight Academy.

00:22:06.890 --> 00:22:10.090
Tristar, Soleil, and now...

00:22:10.610 --> 00:22:12.890
Powa Powa Puririn.

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:16.890
Yes, the independent unit, Powa Powa Puririn.

00:22:17.590 --> 00:22:22.930
Now we have but to search for a sky large enough for all of them to shine.

00:23:55.580 --> 00:23:57.790
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:02.030
Tristar and Soleil's joint live ended up amazing.

00:24:02.030 --> 00:24:04.450
When several groups all perform at the same venue,

00:24:04.450 --> 00:24:06.380
it's called a "joint live".

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:07.420
That's right.

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:09.920
Everyone get pumped up for the joint live!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:12.380
Make sure your concert sells out...

00:24:12.380 --> 00:24:13.960
...by tonight?!

00:24:13.960 --> 00:24:16.250
The concert will be canceled if we don't!

00:24:16.250 --> 00:24:18.470
I'll throw you into the lion's den.

00:24:18.470 --> 00:24:19.870
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.870 --> 00:24:20.850
Go get 'em, Soleil! {needs fixing} {I have no good recommendations, sorry.}

00:24:21.330 --> 00:24:26.030
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
